    <title>神奇的小玩意</title>
    <link href="/2025/03/16/%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%A9%E6%84%8F/"/>
    <url>/2025/03/16/%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%8F%E7%8E%A9%E6%84%8F/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>自己写了个赤石科技，自动连点，代码如下</p><h2 id="右键版本"><a href="#右键版本" class="headerlink" title="右键版本"></a>右键版本</h2><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-comment">/*</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">著作权信息：</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">作者：Mr_Onion</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">二度修改：Mr_Onion</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">修改部分：TopWindow函数</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">源仓库：https://github.com/SuperUseryjh/JiyuKiller</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">开源协议：GNU 通用公共许可证 v3.0</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">二度修改必须再度以  GNU 通用公共许可证 v3.0  授权</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">代码原作者（即Mr_Onion）会对盗用者追责至底，还请给位自觉遵守以上所述的著作权信息</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">如果对于侵犯著作权的定义及惩戒条款的同学，看这个网站：http://ipr.mofcom.gov.cn/article/bzzn/jjzn/zzqjj/201706/1907303.html</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">*/</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span><span class="hljs-string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span><span class="hljs-comment">//右键连点版</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span><span class="hljs-string">&lt;windows.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">using</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> std;<br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">TopWindow</span><span class="hljs-params">(HWND &amp;hWnd)</span> </span>&#123;<br><span class="hljs-built_in">SetWindowPos</span>(hWnd, HWND_TOPMOST, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, SWP_NOMOVE | SWP_NOSIZE);<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span>&#123;<br>HWND hWnd = <span class="hljs-built_in">GetForegroundWindow</span>();<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> n;<br><span class="hljs-built_in">GetCursorPos</span>(&amp;c);<br><span class="hljs-keyword">while</span>(<span class="hljs-number">1</span> == <span class="hljs-number">1</span>)&#123;<br><span class="hljs-built_in">TopWindow</span>(hWnd);<br><span class="hljs-built_in">mouse_event</span>(MOUSEEVENTF_RIGHTDOWN,c.x,c.y,<span class="hljs-number">0</span>,<span class="hljs-number">0</span>);<br><span class="hljs-built_in">mouse_event</span>(MOUSEEVENTF_RIGHTUP,c.x,c.y,<span class="hljs-number">0</span>,<span class="hljs-number">0</span>);<br><span class="hljs-built_in">Sleep</span>(n);<br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="左键版本"><a href="#左键版本" class="headerlink" title="左键版本"></a>左键版本</h2><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-comment">/*</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">著作权信息：</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">作者：Mr_Onion</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">二度修改：Mr_Onion</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">修改部分：TopWindow函数</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">源仓库：https://github.com/SuperUseryjh/JiyuKiller</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">开源协议：GNU 通用公共许可证 v3.0</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">二度修改必须再度以  GNU 通用公共许可证 v3.0  授权</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">代码原作者（即Mr_Onion）会对盗用者追责至底，还请给位自觉遵守以上所述的著作权信息</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">如果对于侵犯著作权的定义及惩戒条款的同学，看这个网站：http://ipr.mofcom.gov.cn/article/bzzn/jjzn/zzqjj/201706/1907303.html</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">*/</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span><span class="hljs-string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span><span class="hljs-comment">//左键点击版</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span><span class="hljs-string">&lt;windows.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">using</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> std;<br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">TopWindow</span><span class="hljs-params">(HWND &amp;hWnd)</span> </span>&#123;<br><span class="hljs-built_in">SetWindowPos</span>(hWnd, HWND_TOPMOST, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, SWP_NOMOVE | SWP_NOSIZE);<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span>&#123;<br>HWND hWnd = <span class="hljs-built_in">GetForegroundWindow</span>();<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> n;<br><span class="hljs-built_in">GetCursorPos</span>(&amp;c);<br><span class="hljs-keyword">while</span>(<span class="hljs-number">1</span> == <span class="hljs-number">1</span>)&#123;<br><span class="hljs-built_in">TopWindow</span>(hWnd);<br><span class="hljs-built_in">mouse_event</span>(MOUSEEVENTF_LEFTDOWN,c.x,c.y,<span class="hljs-number">0</span>,<span class="hljs-number">0</span>);<br><span class="hljs-built_in">mouse_event</span>(MOUSEEVENTF_LEFTUP,c.x,c.y,<span class="hljs-number">0</span>,<span class="hljs-number">0</span>);<br><span class="hljs-built_in">Sleep</span>(n);<br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
